<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Geometric Priors for Generalizable World Models <span id="id1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\titlebreak</span>via Vector Symbolic Architecture</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
