<p id="Sx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This work was supported in part by Nthe DARPA Young Faculty Award, the National Science Foundation (NSF) under Grants #2431561, #2127780, #2319198, #2321840, #2312517, and #2235472, the Semiconductor Research Corporation (SRC), the Office of Naval Research through the Young Investigator Program Award, Grants #N00014-21-1-2225 and #N00014-22-1-2067, Army Research Office Grant #W911NF2410360, and the National Defense Science &amp; Engineering Graduate (NDSEG) Fellowship Program. Additionally, support was provided by the Air Force Office of Scientific Research under Award #FA9550-22-1-0253, along with generous gifts from Xilinx and Cisco.</p>
</div>
</section>
